### tb470.setup -- REBUILT 2026-08-31 against the live bench, from the console.
### Previous version (header "RE-VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11") is
### backups/tb470.setup.bak-2026-08-31 in the bench-setup directory named above -- it no
### longer exists in this configs/ directory. Read items 1-3 before binding anything.
###
